OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome patchy light rain in the
OL,6,Feast to start, but will clear during
OL,7,Fthe morning, with brighter skies
OL,8,Fdeveloping by lunchtime. A few showers
OL,9,Fpossible in the west during the
OL,10,Fafternoon, but many areas stay dry and
OL,11,Fbright. Feeling cooler.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers continue to feed into
OL,14,FCornwall and parts of Devon overnight
OL,15,Fbut staying dry and clear elsewhere.
OL,16,FWinds easing across the region.
OL,17,FFeeling cool for many.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
