OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FAny showers in the west
OL,6,Fwill clear through the morning,
OL,7,Fleaving a mostly dry and bright day
OL,8,Fwith sunny spells. Light winds making
OL,9,Fit feel slightly warmer than Tuesday.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FStaying changeable through the week,
OL,13,Fas another band of rain moves in from
OL,14,Fthe west on Thursday, before drier and
OL,15,Fbrighter weather returns on Friday.
OL,16,FTemperatures likely around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
